%% Estados da OS conduzidos pela saga
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received: OS aberta<br/>cmd enqueue_diagnosis
    received --> in_diagnosis: diagnosis_started
    received --> cancelled: diagnosis_enqueue_failed / timeout
    in_diagnosis --> awaiting_approval: budget_created
    in_diagnosis --> cancelled: budget_creation_failed / timeout
    awaiting_approval --> approved: budget_approved + estoque reservado<br/>+ repair_enqueued
    awaiting_approval --> cancelled: budget_rejected / estoque insuficiente<br/>/ repair_enqueue_failed
    approved --> in_execution: repair_started (pivot)
    in_execution --> finalized: repair_finished<br/>cmd request_payment
    finalized --> delivered: payment_confirmed + entrega
    cancelled --> [*]: saga compensated
    delivered --> [*]: saga completed
